# Auto-detect text files and normalize line endings
* text=auto

# Source code
*.cs text diff=csharp
*.axaml text
*.xaml text
*.csproj text
*.props text
*.slnx text
*.json text
*.ps1 text
*.md text
*.xml text
*.yml text

# Binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary

# 运行时兜底副本：Linux 的宿主没有扩展名，靠 * text=auto 的内容探测不够保险
# （行尾归一化一旦碰它，装出来的宿主就是坏的）
runtime/linux-x64/chenge-preview-host binary
runtime/linux-x64/chenge-runtime binary

# JS libs (vendored, don't normalize)
*.min.js binary
